Fewer FPCR writes around x64 to ARM64EC calls (on top of 0003): only blocks with float math set FPCR.NEP/AH,
compares and float to int conversions only while FPCR.FZ is set, and up to 8 add/sub/mul/div before a call into
ARM64EC code run without AH; NaN lanes of their results are rebuilt with the x86 NaN rules in software.

